<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Airport Management - Services</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
        }

        .navigationBar {
            background-color: #1a1a24;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 50px;
        }

        .navigationBar a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: rgb(150, 164, 210);
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: right;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: inline-block;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 30px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: rgb(243, 242, 242);
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #F3C693;
        }

        .hero-banner {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #150886, #0c073e);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-banner h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .service-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto 60px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .service-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .service-content {
            padding: 35px;
        }

        .service-content h2 {
            font-size: 26px;
            color: #111;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .service-content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .wish-message {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #150886;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="navigationBar">
        <div>
            <a href='/'>DHAKA AIRPORT</a>
        </div>
        <nav>
            <ul id='MenuItems'>
                <li><a href='/'>Home</a></li>
                <li><a href='/service'>Services</a></li>
                <li><a href='/contact'>About Us</a></li>
                <li><a href='/contact'>Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-banner">
        <h1>Dhaka Airport Services</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="service-container">
        <div class="service-card">
            <img src="/images/p1.jpg" alt="Airport Services" class="service-img">
            <div class="service-content">
                <h2>Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (DAC)</h2>
                <p>
                    Find the most important information about Dhaka Airport: Flights (Departures, Arrivals), Parking, Car Rentals, Hotels near the airport and other travel services about Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (DAC). Plan your travel with comprehensive flight guides and seamless airport management.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (IATA: DAC, ICAO: VGHS) serves Dhaka, the capital of Bangladesh, and operates as the premier gateway hub connecting domestic routes and international destinations worldwide with modern terminals and dedicated passenger support.
                </p>
                <p class="wish-message">We wish you a pleasant and safe journey!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>